Welcome to **notizine** - a modular starter for [Zine](https://zine-ssg.io).

This is a demo site showing what you get out of the box:
- **Multilingual** - RU and EN side by side, with a language switcher
- **Sidebar** - recent posts and a full site tree, configured in a single file
- **Dark mode** - respects your OS preference, toggle in the header
- **Search, tags, breadcrumbs** - all optional, toggle on/off in config

To make this your own: edit `content/en/index.smd`, set your `host_url`
in `zine.ziggy`, and customize `assets/notizine.ziggy`.

See the [About](/about/) page for more.
